astBallMaster_Screenshot2.png", "id": "1876173739873412", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393444_1876173743206745_6763138395539482801_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nIKnSwSt-cYQ7kNvwFqo_2y&_nc_oc=AdlNEv8GLJDU74HemHHwzvxUfT4PZS26wadsu7Xv2uG1UTeewqtQpe_LwOpMMnXW2qI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afty8caVlLaaSWIIjm7L0F-aiGS7lKZHLjg4u2A_p2fZrg&oe=69A17873"}, {"file_name": "BlastBallMaster_Screenshot5.png", "id": "1157934832465543", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473400793_1157934839132209_1607817201009102730_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZwkiR1atD2wQ7kNvwHNlv6_&_nc_oc=AdmKuqwtZdYkr4zVGMGoxzu8AvMEFnFm4F9szes5jdqgj-58Oil_iPUY0z6hq2mFqtA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuTORU9UpelXI97z5UKuGaAR16YIcSvgdfaaffQhGieNg&oe=69A17916"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "BlastBallMaster_Logo (2560x1440).png", "id": "1355890215582535", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819281_1355890218915868_2056131209238582864_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jMGUB-H5lZ8Q7kNvwHcaCXv&_nc_oc=AdkDHqXn2d4gHZnfmwz6uoW-pjnRv-FitXfu7bz52qXutHWFf5Wo_oE_RC7f9aTKgek&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afsgit-AJKeBuoL0AaxiHtfg96lbxHxYQvjiCesOvI1LQg&oe=69A197BD"}, "display_name": "Blast Ball Master", "keywords": ["ball", "shoot", "bubble", "match3", "puzzle"], "long_description": "Blast Ball Master is a new vision of the old school Zuma game. \nBlast Ball Master is a puzzle game with a new creative idea.\nBlast Ball Master is interactive and immersive game. Be inside VR.\nBlast Ball Master is a good choice for those who love shooting ball game.\n\nUse 4 boosters: Slow, Freeze, Explosion and Backward Moving! \nUse challenges to get free coins!\nEnjoy colorful effects! \nCool fun music!\nTry different VR hands to get an additional bonus.\nTry Blast Ball Master now!  ", "short_descrip